%% Phase3 / channel / MV3-G10f 会话导向
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/channel/mv3-g10f/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/drawer/chat-settings/chat-settings.component.ts::openOrientDialog；src/pages/message-v3/service/message.service.ts::changeChannelState
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：有权限的成员在群设置里设置群的导向属性，保存后群设置页显示新的导向，群内其他人看到的也是同一个值。
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=none；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: changeChannelState(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channel_change_orient", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channel_change_orient", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channel_change_orient", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 设置群导向（orient） 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /channel/change/orient
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction channel + members + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（channelUpdate，UPDATE_CHANNEL，im:channel:update）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：channel.orient === 入参 orient；允许空串清空，非空内容长度为 1-30 字；channelIsTop / notifyProps.notify / displayName / purpose 逐字段不变；会话列表排序与分组不变（导向不参与排序）
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：orient 缺失或超过 30 字必须显式报错；空串是合法清空，不得当作缺失字段忽略；不得顺带改写 top / notify；它们属于独立 viewer-local Command，绝不能被 orient 的全群广播覆盖
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：channelUpdate，UPDATE_CHANNEL，im:channel:update；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
